<title>UK: ING unit sets 1.5 billion FRF seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>ING unit sets 1.5 billion FRF seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ING AMERICA INSURANCE HOLDINGS</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FRF   COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    21.NOV.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.175   PAY DATE    21.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.65     SPREAD	+26 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    PAR/LUX   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMS US/UK/FR/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  NETHS     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  1.525     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.75 PCT OAT DUE 2003 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
